      "message": "We should not be adding board specific code. This is something we\u0027ll run into with all platforms so it should be fixed in the common logic. Uldrenite\u0027s sensor.c calls gmr_tablet_switch_disable() when it detects it\u0027s running in the EC and is in clamshell. That call ends up calling `gpio_disable_interrupt(GPIO_TABLET_MODE_L);` which should have disabled the interrupt and later calls `tablet_disable();` which should also enable the peripherals. It seems to me that the implementation of `tablet_disable()` might be bailing out early and not actually enabling the peripherals.",
